     {
      "id": "ryland-maxwell-rival",
      "kind": "rival",
      "headline": "Ikarras, the Measuring Stick",
      "body": [
       "Every great back gets measured against Rondale Ikarras, \"The Prodigal Son\", the Ravens legend of the Hall of Fame's inaugural class. The comparison ended Maxwell's way. Ikarras ran for 23,178 yards in 303 games, 76.5 a game; Maxwell finished with 32,108 in 323, 99.4 a game. Ikarras won 9 rings to Maxwell's 13 and 4 Offensive Player of the Year awards, one more than Maxwell, but 5 Super Bowl MVPs to his 7. He never won the MVP. Maxwell won it once, and it completed the set."
      ],
